{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17457","headline":"古意 · 权德舆","name":"古意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家人强进酒，酒後能忘情。\n持杯未饮时，衆感纷已盈。\n明月照我房，庭柯振秋声。\n空庭白露下，枕席凉风生。\n所思万里余，水阔山纵横。\n佳期凭梦想，未晓愁鸡鸣。\n愿将一心人，当年欢乐平。\n长筵暎玉俎，素手弹秦筝。\n𥊑睇呈巧笑，惠音激凄清\n此愿良未果，永怀空如酲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17457.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17457","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}